{"id":"feu","lemma":"feu","pos":"noun","rank":310,"glosses":["fire","lighter, something to light a cigarette with","traffic light"],"ipa":"/fø/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/Fr-feu.ogg/Fr-feu.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"feux"},"formAudio":{"feux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-feux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ma maison était en feu.","en":"My house was on fire.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2358","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Le bateau est en feu.","en":"The boat is on fire.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Y avait-il un feu ?","en":"Was there a fire?","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Vous jouez avec le feu.","en":"You're playing with fire.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to play","l":"jouer"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je déteste les feux d'artifice.","en":"I hate fireworks.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"artifice, trick, ploy"}]}]}